{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bump in the Night is a single-player horror game where you are tasked with investigating a haunted location that features one of many unique ghosts and a multitude of different scares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spooky Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a range of haunted locations, each with distinct map features, challenges, and varying difficulty levels. Certain ghosts may find it easier to use their unique abilities on specific maps or in different ways, and each location offers unique clues for certain types of evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/Untitled-2_0000_Group-1.png?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet Bob and Susan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bob and Susan are at your beck and call! Assign tasks, distribute equipment, and specify areas for investigation as you see fit. Although they're capable of conducting autonomous exploration, strategically directing them towards suspected ghost locations increases the chances of making important discoveries. You can't leave the HQ but they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-63a057d053.gif?t=1734253610\" />And you can trust them. Right? Sure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lead the Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your team has established a command center in one of the rooms on-site, serving as the operational hub for the mission. From here, you can take command by delegating tasks, orders and equipment to your NPC investigators.  Monitor strategically placed cameras through the displays, watching out for paranormal activity. Additionally, document any evidence by taking photos and logging in your journal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-a45372afe7.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deduce the Ghost</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each Ghost has a unique set of three types of evidence it can trigger  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ghosts have distinct personalities. The Trasgo likes to throw objects more than other ghosts. Ectophages like to mess with electronics. Shadows, unsurprisingly, like the darkness. Each of the other ghosts have their own likes, dislikes, and quirks as well.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Finally, each ghost has a unique ability or behavior that typically comes out later in a mission. You'll need to figure out for yourself...  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With these three layers of ghost behavior, clever players will be able to figure out what ghost they're faced with - even if no direct evidence presents itself. However, be cautious, as a wide range of events can still unfold that are applicable to all ghosts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-71423d5772.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stay Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A common staple of the paranormal investigation genre is the &quot;hunt&quot; where the ghost builds up to an active state where it becomes actually dangerous.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ghosts in BITN can indeed enter such a state, but don't think that you are safe outside of those times - far from it. Keep aware, keep vigilant, because death can come for you and the investigators under your command in unexpected ways. Remember, you're in the ghost's territory for the entire duration of your mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-f4d3b3855d.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally Generated</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every investigation is unique, ensuring no two experiences are the same. If you come across an especially intriguing sequence of events, you have the option to save, replay, and share the seed that generated it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regroup at the Office</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rest and restore your faculties at your paranormal investigation firm's office between missions. Read up on lore, pour yourself some coffee, pet some cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-c54ae50ab8.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chat Integrations Galore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitch integrations are all the rage these days, and BITN is no different! Let your viewers take command of Bob and Susan, giving them orders with chat commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not a streamer? No problem! You can enable your Steam friends to control Bob and Susan via Steam chat messages, if you so desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For those not faint of heart, a second level of chat control (both Steam and Twitch) can be enabled allowing viewers to trigger scares and attacks.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Boogeyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/a0de176ca0e22b97a3b00963491c7864086fd726.jpg"},{"name":"Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/f533566e52d0d543236d718d48afa095c71cac56.jpg"},{"name":"Caffeine Rush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/9b61640155c2a49dffce765f7e508eed46d6d0e4.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/c37068e49335157bc3c45a8e147f89ab5614b744.jpg"},{"name":"Martyr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/c37068e49335157bc3c45a8e147f89ab5614b744.jpg"},{"name":"High Roller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/3ee3d8a17f9032747ca083b310cd619599313a0c.jpg"},{"name":"Tree Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/5eaf22e3735f87613c8f55607edb5fdf79ba5056.jpg"},{"name":"Educated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/101307aec0713d093c8ebdd4bfcdcf59901c7bb5.jpg"},{"name":"Spiritual","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/7069ef339bf33745383e24abf43646d671968857.jpg"},{"name":"Chad Bob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819300/904cfde23016ef4a47c0cd98fb32768160a8e978.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819300?t=1734253610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1734253610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734253610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1734253610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2827430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bump in the Night is a single-player horror game where you are tasked with investigating a haunted location that features one of many unique ghosts and a multitude of different scares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spooky Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a range of haunted locations, each with distinct map features, challenges, and varying difficulty levels. Certain ghosts may find it easier to use their unique abilities on specific maps or in different ways, and each location offers unique clues for certain types of evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/Untitled-2_0000_Group-1.png?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet Bob and Susan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bob and Susan are at your beck and call! Assign tasks, distribute equipment, and specify areas for investigation as you see fit. Although they're capable of conducting autonomous exploration, strategically directing them towards suspected ghost locations increases the chances of making important discoveries. You can't leave the HQ but they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-63a057d053.gif?t=1734253610\" />And you can trust them. Right? Sure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lead the Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your team has established a command center in one of the rooms on-site, serving as the operational hub for the mission. From here, you can take command by delegating tasks, orders and equipment to your NPC investigators.  Monitor strategically placed cameras through the displays, watching out for paranormal activity. Additionally, document any evidence by taking photos and logging in your journal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-a45372afe7.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deduce the Ghost</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each Ghost has a unique set of three types of evidence it can trigger  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ghosts have distinct personalities. The Trasgo likes to throw objects more than other ghosts. Ectophages like to mess with electronics. Shadows, unsurprisingly, like the darkness. Each of the other ghosts have their own likes, dislikes, and quirks as well.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Finally, each ghost has a unique ability or behavior that typically comes out later in a mission. You'll need to figure out for yourself...  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With these three layers of ghost behavior, clever players will be able to figure out what ghost they're faced with - even if no direct evidence presents itself. However, be cautious, as a wide range of events can still unfold that are applicable to all ghosts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-71423d5772.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stay Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A common staple of the paranormal investigation genre is the &quot;hunt&quot; where the ghost builds up to an active state where it becomes actually dangerous.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ghosts in BITN can indeed enter such a state, but don't think that you are safe outside of those times - far from it. Keep aware, keep vigilant, because death can come for you and the investigators under your command in unexpected ways. Remember, you're in the ghost's territory for the entire duration of your mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-f4d3b3855d.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally Generated</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every investigation is unique, ensuring no two experiences are the same. If you come across an especially intriguing sequence of events, you have the option to save, replay, and share the seed that generated it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regroup at the Office</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rest and restore your faculties at your paranormal investigation firm's office between missions. Read up on lore, pour yourself some coffee, pet some cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/extras/ezgif-3-c54ae50ab8.gif?t=1734253610\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chat Integrations Galore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitch integrations are all the rage these days, and BITN is no different! Let your viewers take command of Bob and Susan, giving them orders with chat commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not a streamer? No problem! You can enable your Steam friends to control Bob and Susan via Steam chat messages, if you so desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For those not faint of heart, a second level of chat control (both Steam and Twitch) can be enabled allowing viewers to trigger scares and attacks.</p>","developers":["Elzolabs"],"dlc":[3269820],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819300/header.jpg?t=1734253610","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257000659,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257000659/movie480.mp4?t=1729580868","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257000659/movie_max.mp4?t=1729580868"},"name":"BITN Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257000659/693f97c14e8c1a928fae995307d3b941343c7ff2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1